<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>title</key>
    <string>通知消散</string>
    <key>items</key>
    <array>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>通知、横幅与桌面图标</string>
        <key>footerText</key>
        <string>系统负责删除通知或应用；仅在桌面模型实际移除应用图标后播放颗粒。取消、拖动和翻页不触发。图标接口不匹配时保留原生效果。</string>
    </dict>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSSwitchCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>通知消散</string>
        <key>default</key>
        <true/>
        <key>defaults</key>
        <string>com.example.noticelisttweak</string>
        <key>key</key>
        <string>Enabled</string>
        <key>PostNotification</key>
        <string>com.example.noticelisttweak/preferencesChanged</string>
    </dict>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
        <key>label</key><string>桌面图标消散</string>
        <key>default</key><true/>
        <key>defaults</key><string>com.example.noticelisttweak</string>
        <key>key</key><string>HomeIconDustEnabled</string>
        <key>PostNotification</key><string>com.example.noticelisttweak/preferencesChanged</string>
    </dict>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
        <key>label</key><string>来消息横幅消散</string>
        <key>default</key><true/>
        <key>defaults</key><string>com.example.noticelisttweak</string>
        <key>key</key><string>BannerDustEnabled</string>
        <key>PostNotification</key><string>com.example.noticelisttweak/preferencesChanged</string>
    </dict>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>footerText</key><string>跟随系统及灵动通知原本的收回时机播放消散，不另设倒计时。自动收回、手动收起、点击离开都尝试替换动画；展开详情或常驻图标切换仍保留原有行为。TrollOpen、Nice 灵动通知在匹配接口后自动接入。</string>
    </dict>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key><string>PSButtonCell</string>
        <key>label</key><string>横幅运行状态</string>
        <key>action</key><string>showBannerStatus</string>
        <key>id</key><string>BannerRuntimeStatus</string>
    </dict>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSSliderCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>消散时长（秒）</string>
        <key>default</key>
        <real>1.3</real>
        <key>min</key>
        <real>0.7</real>
        <key>max</key>
        <real>2.5</real>
        <key>showValue</key>
        <true/>
        <key>defaults</key>
        <string>com.example.noticelisttweak</string>
        <key>key</key>
        <string>DustDuration</string>
        <key>PostNotification</key>
        <string>com.example.noticelisttweak/preferencesChanged</string>
    </dict>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSSliderCell</string>
        <key>label</key>
        <string>飘散距离</string>
        <key>default</key>
        <real>110.0</real>
        <key>min</key>
        <real>40.0</real>
        <key>max</key>
        <real>200.0</real>
        <key>showValue</key>
        <true/>
        <key>defaults</key>
        <string>com.example.noticelisttweak</string>
        <key>key</key>
        <string>DustDistance</string>
        <key>PostNotification</key>
        <string>com.example.noticelisttweak/preferencesChanged</string>
    </dict>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key><string>PSSliderCell</string>
        <key>label</key><string>颗粒精细度</string>
        <key>default</key><real>14000</real>
        <key>min</key><real>4000</real>
        <key>max</key><real>20000</real>
        <key>showValue</key><true/>
        <key>defaults</key><string>com.example.noticelisttweak</string>
        <key>key</key><string>DustParticles</string>
        <key>PostNotification</key><string>com.example.noticelisttweak/preferencesChanged</string>
    </dict>
    <dict>
        <key>cell</key>
        <string>PSGroupCell</string>
        <key>footerText</key>
        <string>通知碎成细颗粒后飘散；精细度越高，开销越大。系统“减弱动态效果”开启时保留原生删除。修改后下一次清除生效。</string>
    </dict>
</array>
</dict>
</plist>
